te expectation-recording with that evidence, mark candidate-review not_performed, work_result=null. Return the original closed return and stop; the later same-Reviewer candidate phase needs the actual expectation pinned in a new contract. Do not repeat schema research or create scratch files. 600s is a ceiling.\\n\\nReturn exactly one a_c.fd-support.closed-return/1 JSON object. Copy frame={id,revision} from Context.packet.frame; activation from Context.boundaries.activation_identity; subject from packet.subject_basis.subject; basis={method_profile:packet.subject_basis.method_profile,observations:packet.subject_basis.observations}; actor={id:packet.actor_authority.actor_id,family/authorship exactly as stated below}; consumer=packet.evidence_relations.consumer. Other keys: id, evaluations, not_performed, work_result, residuals, invalidators. Each performed evaluation is {id,predicate:exact SourceRef from RETURN-CONTRACT,domain_outcome:your actual finding,core_value:satisfied|falsified|indeterminate|out_of_frame|invalid_basis,evidence:[actual SourceRef/ArtifactRef],residuals:[],invalidators:[]}. Worker work_result is {value:candidate_ready|incomplete|refused|re_entry_requested,cause,candidate:exact SourceRef or null,evidence:[actual acquired transition evidence],residuals:[]}; Reviewer work_result=null. Do not fabricate evaluations or replace original Context observations. No result interpreter or response repair is supplied.\\n\",\"coordinates\":null,\"encoding\":\"utf8\",\"parent_sha256\":\"1dd60957394d321b19acbbe11b06501f24185015d3feeaab65fe9addc237d011\",\"selected_sha256\":\"1dd60957394d321b19acbbe11b06501f24185015d3feeaab65fe9addc237d011\",\"size_bytes\":2095,\"source\":{\"engine\":\"workspace-regular-file\",\"object\":null,\"path\":\"roles/reviewer-TASK.md\",\"root\":\"control\",\"selector\":null,\"sha256\":\"1dd60957394d321b19acbbe11b06501f24185015d3feeaab65fe9addc237d011\"}}},\"schema\":\"a_c.fd-support.response/1\",\"status\":\"ok\"}"}],"structured_content":{