{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"agent_message","text":"R1 and D1 require the exact UTF-8 bytes `Hello, Ada.\\n`. R2 also requires the bound Worker/Reviewer handoff and single-file scope evidence. I’m recording these expectations before candidate acquisition, with the declared same-family independence limit retained.\n\n"}}
